                                                "sense_id": "d31400fb-6a1f-387d-acca-0f3b9ca58c8a",
                                                "text": "2022, Mark van der Feyst, Matt Wehrle, Rob Wiggins, The Tactical Firefighter\nThere have been many rescues made as a result of an aggressive search team who went in without a hoseline to make the grab."
